 ## Retries
 
-A capture that times out is tried again, up to 3 attempts in all, one after the other.
+A capture that times out is tried again, with a growing pause between attempts. The
+[capture loop](../../larder/capture.py) defines the attempt limit and delays.
+
+Friday gateway slowdowns from 17:00 to 19:00 left 58 confirmed pantry orders uncharged, requiring a volunteer to
+capture them by hand the next morning. The previous three attempts ran within a second and all hit the same slow
+period. A sandbox replay with more attempts and growing pauses would have recovered 57 of those 58 captures.
+The team accepted up to 20 seconds of extra waiting on the confirmation page to reduce manual captures. Switching
+gateways was ruled out because the contract runs through December 2026. These findings and the accepted trade-off
+are recorded in [issue 40](../../notes/issue-40.md).
 
